msgid "Enable Test Mode"
msgstr "Aktivér testtilstand"

#: includes/class-gateway.php:98
msgid "Place the payment gateway in test mode using playground API."
msgstr "Kør betalingsmodulet i testtilstand mod playground-API'et."

#: includes/class-gateway.php:103
msgid "Enable Briqpay Order Management"
msgstr "Aktivér Briqpay ordrehåndtering"

#: includes/class-gateway.php:104
msgid "Enable Order Management"
msgstr "Aktivér ordrehåndtering"

#: includes/class-gateway.php:106
msgid ""
"If enabled, captures and refunds will be handled automatically towards "
"Briqpay."
msgstr "Når dette er aktiveret, håndteres hævninger og refunderinger automatisk mod Briqpay."

#: includes/class-gateway.php:111
msgid "Validate Terms & Conditions"
msgstr "Kontrollér handelsbetingelser"

#: includes/class-gateway.php:112
msgid "Require the WooCommerce Terms & Conditions checkbox"
msgstr "Kræv WooCommerces afkrydsningsfelt for handelsbetingelser"

#: includes/class-gateway.php:114
msgid ""
"When enabled, a purchase is rejected at the payment decision unless the "
"customer ticked WooCommerce's native Terms & Conditions checkbox. Disable "
"this if you collect consent elsewhere - for example with Briqpay's own terms "
"module, or a third-party consent plugin - to avoid asking the customer "
"twice. Has no effect when WooCommerce has no Terms and conditions page "
"configured."
msgstr "Når dette er aktiveret, afvises et køb ved betalingsafgørelsen, hvis kunden ikke har markeret WooCommerces eget felt for handelsbetingelser. Slå det fra, hvis du indsamler samtykke på anden vis – for eksempel med Briqpays eget betingelsesmodul eller et tredjepartsplugin – så kunden ikke skal godkende to gange. Har ingen effekt, hvis WooCommerce ikke har en side med handelsbetingelser konfigureret."

#: includes/class-gateway.php:119
msgid "WooCommerce checkout actions"
msgstr "WooCommerce checkout-handlinger"

#: includes/class-gateway.php:120
msgid "Fire WooCommerce's standard checkout actions"
msgstr "Udfør WooCommerces almindelige checkout-handlinger"

#: includes/class-gateway.php:122
msgid ""
"Lets third-party plugins (custom checkout fields, ERP and invoicing "
"connectors, delivery-date pickers) receive Briqpay orders the same way they "
"receive orders paid with other methods. <strong>Before enabling, check any "
"custom code you added to compensate for these actions being missing</strong> "
"- for example on <code>briqpay_after_create_order</code> - because it will "
"now run alongside the plugins it was standing in for. Existing stores keep "
"this off until you turn it on."
msgstr "Lader tredjepartsplugins (egne checkout-felter, ERP- og faktureringsintegrationer, valg af leveringsdato) modtage Briqpay-ordrer på samme måde som ordrer betalt med andre metoder. <strong>Inden du aktiverer dette, gennemgå eventuel egen kode, du har tilføjet for at kompensere for, at disse handlinger manglede</strong> – for eksempel på <code>briqpay_after_create_order</code> – fordi den nu kører sammen med de plugins, den erstattede. Eksisterende butikker har dette slået fra, indtil du selv slår det til."

#: includes/class-gateway.php:127
msgid "Hosted Payment Pages"
msgstr "Betalingssider"

#: includes/class-gateway.php:129
msgid ""
"Create a Briqpay hosted payment page for an order you have built in the "
"WooCommerce admin, then send the link to your customer."
msgstr "Opret en Briqpay-betalingsside til en ordre, du har bygget i WooCommerce-administrationen, og send linket til din kunde."

#: includes/class-gateway.php:132 includes/class-gateway.php:133
msgid "Enable Hosted Payment Pages"
msgstr "Aktivér betalingssider"

#: includes/class-gateway.php:135
msgid "Adds a \"Briqpay Hosted Payment Page\" box to the order edit screen."
msgstr "Tilføjer boksen \"Briqpay betalingsside\" på ordreredigeringssiden."

