msgstr "Indstillinger for butikker, der migrerer fra det tidligere plugin Briqpay for WooCommerce."

#: includes/class-gateway.php:192
msgid "Legacy B2B order meta mapping"
msgstr "Ældre metatilknytning for B2B-ordrer"

#: includes/class-gateway.php:193
msgid "Also store B2B order data using the previous plugin's meta keys"
msgstr "Gem også B2B-ordredata med det tidligere plugins metanøgler"

#: includes/class-gateway.php:195
msgid ""
"For stores migrating from the previous Briqpay plugin. B2B orders "
"additionally store the organisation number in <code>_billing_org_nr</code> "
"and the shipping email in <code>_shipping_email</code>, so existing ERP "
"exports and integrations keep working. Current meta keys are always written "
"as well."
msgstr "Til butikker, der migrerer fra det tidligere Briqpay-plugin. B2B-ordrer gemmer desuden CVR-nummeret i <code>_billing_org_nr</code> og leveringsadressens e-mail i <code>_shipping_email</code>, så eksisterende ERP-eksporter og integrationer fortsat virker. De nuværende metanøgler skrives altid også."

#: includes/class-gateway.php:373
